    "UIName": "Antlion LK-3D",
    "Id": "mechdef_antlion_LK-3D",
    "Name": "Antlion LK-3D",
    "Details": "The Antlion mounts a pair of Clan-tech Mech Mortar/4, one in the left torso and one in the right, both fed by six tons of ammunition secured deep inside the right torso and protected by CASE II. This ample supply of ammunition allows the Antlion to conduct substantial bombardments, if it has the time and opportunity to do so; however, the only other weapons mounted onto the Antlion are a pair of light machine guns mounted in its head. Relatively slow despite the use of a 225 XL engine, XL gyro, and small cockpit, the Antlion combined nine and a half tons of light ferro-fibrous armor with a reinforced structure for survivability, although a great deal of the Antlion's defense depended on the Bloodhound active probe each 'Mech was equipped with.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_antlion"
  },
